# Iran Technology and Innovation Management Association

## Stack

- Nuxt and Vue 3. Only `<script setup lang="ts">`.
- Routes live in `app/pages/`. Components live in `app/components/` and are auto-imported.
- Public pages read the content API with `useAsyncData` or `useFetch` on the server. Do not hardcode interface or body copy in components. Account UI strings live in `app/copy/panel.json`.
- Images use `NuxtImg` or `NuxtPicture` from `@nuxt/image`.
- Production is `pnpm build`, then `node .output/server/index.mjs`. Account, admin, and payment routes stay `ssr: false`.

## RTL

The site is fully right-to-left (`lang=fa` and `dir=rtl` on `html`). Logical properties only.

```html
<!-- bad -->
<div class="ml-4 pl-6 text-left left-0">
<!-- good -->
<div class="ms-4 ps-6 text-start start-0">
```

`left`, `right`, `ml`, `mr`, `pl`, `pr`, `text-left`, and `text-right` are forbidden. A directional icon (arrow, chevron) gets `rtl:-scale-x-100`.

## Design

Keep the class names and rules in `app/assets/css/ifp.rtl.css` (`site-header`, `home-splash`, `home-spotlight-intro`, `post-listing__*`, `project-list--layout-3-col`, `newsletter-pre-footer`, `site-footer`, and the rest). Match that stylesheet and the current templates.

- Both Söhne and Tiempos Text map to `IRANYekan, Tahoma, sans-serif`. Uppercase and letter-spacing are neutralized; font-weight stays.
- Colours in that sheet are custom properties on `:root`. Paper is `#FFFDF5`, ink and rules are `#2B2B33`, the hero is `#2D317A` with paper text, emphasis is `#6866AD` for text, links, icons, and hairlines, and `#6A64AB` for solid fills. The newsletter, footer, and dark header are `#06011E`. Meta stays `#999`. Panels are `#FAF9F7`. Topic colours cycle `#2D317A`, `#6967AC`, `#9A96CA`, `#3F50A0`. Label text on `#9A96CA` is `#06011E`. Text on `#6866AD` and `#6A64AB` is `#FFFDF5`.
- Tailwind preflight is off. Use Tailwind only for association-specific UI.
- Headings, text, and labels use IRANYekan (`font-heading`, `font-sans`, and `font-serif`), with Tahoma as the fallback. The FaNum woff2 and woff files live in `public/fonts/iranyekan/` and are declared in `app/assets/css/fonts.css`.
- Display dates are Jalali with Persian digits (`formatPersianDate`). Keep dates as ISO in the API.

## Content and SEO

- Every page calls `usePageSeo` with a Persian title and description and `ogLocale: fa_IR`.
- A missing public record throws `createError({ statusCode: 404 })`.
